    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d311">

                <pb facs="0429" n="323" xml:id="pg323"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Señor Pedro Montt to
                        Mr. Blaine</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the Constitutional Government of Chile</hi>,<lb/>1325
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">G Street NW</hi>.,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1891-08-28"><hi rendition="#italic">August
                                28, 1891</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I am directed by the minister of foreign
                    affairs to lay before the Government of the United States the following
                    cablegram: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p rendition="#center">[Translation.]</p>
                        <p>Balmaceda has been routed for the second time. To-day, after the victory
                            of the congressional forces outside of the city, Valparaiso was
                            surrendered to the German admiral, who placed it under the orders of
                            Congress. Inform Government.</p>
                        <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Errazuriz</hi>.</p>
                        <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Iquique</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">August
                                28, 1891</hi>.</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed>
                        <list>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Pedro Montt</hi>.</item>
                            <item>Per <hi rendition="#small-caps">Julio M. Foster</hi>.</item>
                        </list>
                    </signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
